error[unwritten-element]: reads element before any write
 --> src/UnwrittenElementPositive.jl:8:12
  |
6 |     y = similar(x)
  |         ---------- allocates without values here
7 |     y[1] = 2x[1]
8 |     return sum(y)
  |            ^^^^^^ reads unwritten element
  |
  = why: `undef` element holds garbage bits, or throws `UndefRefError` for non-bits element
  = fix: write every element first (`fill!`, `copyto!`, or loop over `eachindex`), or allocate with `zeros`, `fill` or `map`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain unwritten-element
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow unwritten-element -- <reason>`

